Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:29.40,DCMain,HAIBARA,0,0,0,,معبر قطار
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:30.87,DCMain,HAIBARA,0,0,0,,!لا بد أنه هو
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:32.92,DCMain,HAIBARA,0,0,0,,!عرفت وجهتهم
